<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no">
    <meta name="description" content="Where Lancaster Pet Movers travels: pet transport across the United States and international pet relocation to countries including Australia, the UK and New Zealand.">
    <title>Service Locations | <%= business.name %></title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/png" href="/images/img/favicon.png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/slicknav.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/custom.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/content-pages.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="/css/brand.css" rel="stylesheet">
<%- include('../partials/chat') %>
<link href="/css/zoom.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/site-header') %>
    <div class="page-header"><div class="container"><div class="page-header-box"><h2>Service Locations</h2><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="breadcrumb"><li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li><li>Locations</li></ol></nav></div></div></div>

    <main class="content-page">
        <div class="container">
            <section class="content-intro">
                <div class="content-kicker">Where we travel</div>
                <h1>Bringing pets and families together, wherever you move</h1>
                <p>We plan pet journeys across the United States and help families relocate abroad with their pets, working with airlines and trusted partners along the way.</p>
            </section>

            <div class="locations-grid">
                <article class="location-card"><div class="location-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-flag-usa" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h2>United States</h2><p>Door-to-door ground transport and domestic pet flights between cities across the country.</p></article>
                <article class="location-card"><div class="location-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-oceania" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h2>Australia</h2><p>Relocation planning for Australia's strict pet import rules, including permits, testing and timelines.</p></article>
                <article class="location-card"><div class="location-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-bridge" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h2>United Kingdom</h2><p>Help with UK pet entry requirements, from microchip and rabies timing to tapeworm treatment for dogs.</p></article>
                <article class="location-card"><div class="location-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h2>New Zealand</h2><p>Step-by-step planning for New Zealand's pet import process and arrival requirements.</p></article>
                <article class="location-card location-card-global"><div class="location-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-globe" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h2>Other countries</h2><p>Moving somewhere else? We review the destination's pet entry rules and airline options for your route.</p></article>
            </div>

            <section class="coverage-note"><div><h2>Moving somewhere else?</h2><p>Tell us where you're moving, about your pet and when you need to travel. We'll check the entry rules and the best route.</p></div><a href="/quote" class="btn-default">Get a Free Quote</a></section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/site-footer') %>
    
    <script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
